      "content": "The grid has rotational symmetry. Not all letters are checked.\\n\\n**Across**\\n\\nWeakens recall of rest, mirroring area taken from cross cover  \\nAre faceless cats snatching answer taken from page substitutes?  \\nSplitting granite pieces up (2 wds.)  \\nFive turned up after bachelor's display  \\nChumps guard overturned Zulu dramas  \\nBolshevik mixer is south, counterclockwise  \\nAthlete supporter is up to write suburban odds out (2 wds.)  \\nQuiet week overturned by multiplicative identity for ring  \\nExchanges small hybrid of ampere and inverted mirrored newton by three sizes  \\nHappiest and boldest change of heart to invert around hybrid with Internet  \\nGet used to imprisoning overturned queen's hybrid with pawn, lab experiment is not fixable  \\nAdvanced inverted hybrid with judge takes second place in bouts, then takes off  \\nPaddled and put into horizontal lines  \\nReview amateur as Ōkami lead  \\nHawked anti-diagonal mirror of hearts between pedestrian light  \\nStudents in class revolted twice, divided by a hybrid with inverted Times\\n\\n**Down**\\n\\nVictor turned over after half-deterred saint slipped up and can't stand  \\nSouth America fiber is made from owl ma (2 wds.)  \\nThree directions in fool's female attire  \\nPortents of Juliet, mirrored, overlaid on ecstasy, carrying stuck-up curtailed heart south  \\nAre pack agents hiding issue with new look?  \\nShort course with great slang has green square with dollar sign (2 wds.)  \\nTreaded water with one teacher  \\nDarling has small, small bind  \\nTeaching aid lacks large spinal surface  \\nLatin square's fourth line to cover layered dessert (2 wds.)  \\nWhat sounds like to agitate!  \\nPastry with short ends and rough caramel base  \\nLists right, turns up empty, overlaid on adult cows lacking energy  \\nUncertain matters can be buzzer races, at times  \\nBrowbeaten mixed school held ace-jack hybrid  \\nSpecific past deed?"
