    "a8cccef9": {
      "hash": "2551afc58b96402d8a623e0d4acb50570656dc8cb5aea957525d624b9aec0e64",
      "content": "There was a quote about not providing profanity. What was the author's last name?\\n\\nThere was a quote about the pain of not sharing your tale. What was the title?\\n\\nThere was a quote about six uncomfortable things a character wants. Who was the main female character?\\n\\nThere was a quote about gathering in Long Island. What was the second word of the title?\\n\\nThere was a quote about someone else's beverage. What was the name of its book?\\n\\nThere was a quote about a mythical being gaslighting. What was the home country of the character trying to catch the person who escapes at the end?\\n\\nThere was a quote about someone's worst gambling results. What was the author's first name?\\n\\nThere was a quote about being able to take care of small mammals. What was the rodent-related word in the title?\\n\\nThere was a quote about the semantics of people being stuck in the same location. What was the number of entries in the series?\\n\\n---\\n\\nA story of a dystopian state-controlled society and an outsider introduced into it.\\t[2]\\n\\nA story of a man who wants to forget, but then wants to remember.\\t[1]\\n\\nA story of a young woman trying to protect her family's home and her various romantic entanglements.\\t[3]\\n\\nA story of a girl (the author herself) coming of age while dealing with racism and trauma.\\t[7]\\n\\nA story of a hunter finding a large sum of money and being pursued by a hitman.\\t[3]\\n\\nA story of a pair of migrant workers looking for work and dreaming of a better life.\\t[3]\\n\\nA story of a lone survivor telling a tale to the authorities.\\t[1]\\n\\nA story of a prospector who destroys everything around him in pursuit of a fortune.\\t[1]\\n\\nA story of a group investigating a former colleague's death and uncovering a Cold War era conspiracy.\\t[6]"
    },
