      "speaker": "camille",
      "dialogue": "{pace=1..1.5}History! Mankind’s relationship with the stars — constellations, myths, *dreams*! Oh and you’ve *got* to see the art installation at the end — I really hope it’s still there — representing our collective yearning to escape the confines of our planet and be one amongst the stars. What are you waiting for? Let’s go!",
