      "speaker": "dj",
      "dialogue": "{pace=1..3}They’re kind of my favorite pairing from the show. I think they’re generally not as popular as some of the other characters, since they’re kind of quiet and not really as outgoing as a lot of the other characters, but their relationship is so wholesome, and in Season 2 Episode 20 when they’re together alone in Anya’s dorm, and we *finally* got to see them cuddle for the first time, after an *entire* season of will-they-won’t-they, it just really stuck with me, and I *had* to draw it!",
